            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to MECH LEAGUE Boxing—an adrenaline-pumping, metal-punching VR boxing experience. Step into your mech and rise through the ranks using powerful punches, well-timed dodges, and precise counters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every hit. Break a sweat. Earn your way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where mech battles are the ultimate escape, robot fighting has become the arena where champions are made. Now it’s your turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MECH LEAGUE Boxing is a full-body VR game and workout where every punch, dodge, and counter is powered by real movement. No buttons—just pure VR combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body VR combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, block, and dodge in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR workout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn calories and build stamina while you fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Test your reflexes in intense VR fighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intergalactic arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle across unique locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sharpen your skills and rise through the ranks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons &amp; mech combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grab, smash, and dominate your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your mech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade gloves, helmets, and gear.</p>",
